        "original_id": "d0d194b2-8de3-50e0-9190-9262ff75d787",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Homer Simpson, Dan Castellaneta\n- Products: The Simpsons, The Tracey Ullman Show, Good Night\n- Concepts: fictional characters, voice acting\n\nFacts:\n- Homer Simpson is a fictional character and the main protagonist of the American animated television series The Simpsons.\n- Homer Simpson is the patriarch of the Simpson family in The Simpsons.\n- Homer Simpson first appeared on television with the rest of his family in the The Tracey Ullman Show short Good Night on April 19, 1987.\n- Dan Castellaneta voices Homer Simpson.\n- Dan Castellaneta was born on October 29, 1957.\n- Dan Castellaneta is an American actor, voice actor, comedian, and screenwriter.",
